OrderingViews::relayView - sequence rendering (view def SequenceView)

part left
  event occurrence lateSent
  event occurrence earlySent
part right
  event occurrence lateTaken
  event occurrence earlyTaken

messages:
  left.earlySent -> right.earlyTaken: early of Tick
  right.earlyTaken -> left.lateSent
  left.lateSent -> right.lateTaken: late of Tick
